chip is esp32.
module is esp32-wroom-32.
board is devkit-v1.
wifi is off.
bluetooth is off.
console is on uart0.
gpio 16 is output "row 1" with no pull.
gpio 17 is output "row 2" with no pull.
gpio 34 is input "col 1" with external pull-up.
gpio 32 is input "enc a" with internal pull-up.
gpio 27 is input "enc sw" with internal pull-up.
gpio 26 is output "i2s bclk" with no pull.
gpio 25 is output "i2s lrc" with no pull.
gpio 33 is output "i2s din" with no pull.
gpio 2 is output "probe scan" with no pull.
gpio 4 is output "spare" with no pull.
